Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.43,0:00:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Make a human friend you can trust,\Nand reveal to them your elfin identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,After the 3rd of July, open Task 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Work with your friend on task three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.49,0:00:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's your second task?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,From the looks of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,your second task is already complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.87,0:00:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.81,0:00:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean you can stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go on missions together!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.81,0:00:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Not the response I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.11,0:00:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did he ask you to team up with a human to complete it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.25,0:00:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Can someone without experience help?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.26,0:00:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,When you accepted the mission,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you consider the fact that Xiaobai is only in elementry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:49.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If I can't help, Gen surely can.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.36,0:00:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There doesn't seem to be a limit on how many can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll see later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,July 3rd is tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you able to look fully human yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.82,0:00:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.98,0:01:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just stay in cat form for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Having cat ears and white hair might draw unwanted attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.93,0:01:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't he just wear a hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.88,0:01:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be more comfortable in my cat form.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't the guild master talk about people who can change your form?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.72,0:01:12.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's only visually.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.62,0:01:23.30,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,710)}{\fad(5000,3000)}Spiritual Powers \Nin Another World
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.92,0:01:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to get better at it gradually.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.42,0:01:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you look cute with cat ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.92,0:01:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.01,0:01:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.20,0:01:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still too early, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.59,0:01:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I assumed you were in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.40,0:01:36.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw you weren't online yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.09,0:01:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it wasn't for another hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.54,0:01:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.82,0:01:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You can get in early.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't come, we wouldn't have been able to log in together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, just leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.69,0:01:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't bring your console?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.62,0:01:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we can play up to four people on just one. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You should play with us, Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.07,0:01:56.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin says it's a ton of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.99,0:01:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? What's it called?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.52,0:01:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,All Living Creatures
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.80,0:02:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You've heard of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.64,0:02:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I've seen it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.98,0:02:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.19,0:02:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play together then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.91,0:02:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you should play too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys must've been excited for this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what this game is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.42,0:02:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how popular it is..?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.14,0:02:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,How on earthly did you get the limit edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.10,0:02:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Let's get straight to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.03,0:02:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One receiver per person. First, put it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.27,0:02:31.40,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's so light, it's like a eye mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.04,0:02:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, you gotta connect to the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm setting it up so we're all in the same lobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.22,0:02:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, we should be ready to go at 9:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.36,0:02:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is to be played in bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.43,0:02:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Just lie down and press this button on the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.21,0:02:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you the rest after we get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.81,0:03:11.22,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Hello and welcome to\N'All Living Creatures'.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.02,0:03:14.25,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Please state your username.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.00,0:03:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaobai.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:19.33,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Please select your character's race.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.81,0:03:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah, there's so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.60,0:03:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Aren't these all animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:27.92,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is a game feature of 'All Living Creatures'. 
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:29.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I change it afterwards?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.22,0:03:33.02,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Changes cannot be made unless the account is deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.90,0:03:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll stick with being human, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.71,0:03:42.71,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Do you want to create a new look or use your own appearance?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.53,0:03:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Use my own appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:48.22,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Would you like to change clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.24,0:03:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope. This works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.90,0:03:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.67,0:03:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A baby chick?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bird!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.71,0:03:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:00.84,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Would you like to set up a subsidiary account?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:04.94,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,This is a special option given to you \Nbased on your unique situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.21,0:04:06.73,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.02,0:04:08.95,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Welcome to 'All Living Creatures'.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.13,0:04:11.58,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Please wait in the online lobby for the game to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.61,0:04:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! Xiaohei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:16.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.77,0:04:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So cats can play, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.59,0:04:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is quite the discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.22,0:04:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had known, I would have brought Huangshou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.98,0:04:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.43,0:04:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You both chose human. How boring.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.69,0:04:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.54,0:04:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:32.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of game is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a virtual reality game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It perfectly stimulates the senses in our brain, \Nto create the most realistic game ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.79,0:04:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This feels too real...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.10,0:04:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.51,0:04:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:44.69,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.23,0:04:44.69,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.03,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't know until the game starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They didn't reveal anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.22,0:04:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But because of this games revolutionary technology, \Nthe game has been selling like crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.01,0:04:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Launch day has obtained an incredible amount of hype.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.49,0:04:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you feel it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.92,0:04:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.03,0:05:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like we're in completely different worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.25,0:05:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the game is about to be unveiled!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.55,0:05:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And, amazingly, you can choose to be any creature you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.40,0:05:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So I chose what I always wanted to be! A bird!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.28,0:05:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,But flying is a lot harder than it looks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.32,0:05:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really just a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.63,0:05:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's amazing. It just feels so real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.02,0:05:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but they nerfed any pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd they to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to 'All Living Creatures'!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am M.T., your guide for this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall now explain the basics of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.12,0:05:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a brand new open-world game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.07,0:05:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,As you explore, you will discover more about the game and it's world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:42.92,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I swear I've seen them before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to check our official website for any updates.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.21,0:05:45.21,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}This is their company logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.35,0:05:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go over some things before you begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.21,0:05:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Some pertain to the life system in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.93,0:05:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go over some of the basic mechanics of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.53,0:05:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If a character is downed, \Nand is not revived within ten seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That character will be deleted.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.45,0:06:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Deleted!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct. All characters in this game are real players. \NEach player gets one character.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.46,0:06:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,After a character has been deleted,\Nthe player will respawn as a new character.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.61,0:06:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The player cannot enter until after a 30-minute cooldown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.98,0:06:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So, protect yourself just as you would in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.04,0:06:17.79,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Using a hardcore penalty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:18.59,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Um..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I get it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.95,0:06:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can bring up the user interface just by thinking "Open".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.15,0:06:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,To optimize the gaming experience, your interface is visible only to your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.85,0:06:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't have any further questions, you can mark yourself as "Ready".
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.70,0:06:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Once it hits 10 o'clock, you can start the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.73,0:06:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, no tutorial?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.48,0:06:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to stay together once we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.13,0:06:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's going to be crowded in the starting zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.05,0:06:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's probably not going to be safe until we familiarize ourselves with the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.73,0:06:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already in each others' friends list.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So if we do get separated,\Nwe can find each other using location tracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.45,0:06:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Below the our names is the experience bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.08,0:06:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fill it up to level up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.46,0:07:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Leveling up gives you skill points,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.83,0:07:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,which you use to learn skills and abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.22,0:07:03.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's also a quest log.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,, Once you accept a quest, it'll show up here, but it's empty now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's the shop, but there isn't much in it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.26,0:07:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This side is the Combat Support System.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to see what it does once we're inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.01,Default,,0,0,0,,All good?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.14,0:07:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get ready to log in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:19.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh right, is there no server selection?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.94,0:07:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, all players are on one single server.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...That's intense, so many players and no server splitting?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.28,0:07:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So... should we log in now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.15,0:07:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, let's log in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.18,0:07:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we... inside the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.80,0:07:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.31,0:08:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But how come there's no one here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.45,0:08:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.12,0:08:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.29,0:08:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,New message?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:28.43,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,"I can't speak!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what makes it realistic, birds obviously can't talk
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.43,0:08:37.18,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,"Tired of typing!"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.10,0:08:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So annoying...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.10,0:08:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to familiarize myself with the UI for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.52,0:08:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Only shows up to three kilometers around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.19,0:08:48.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So we have to explore this area first?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.94,0:08:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, you can't read this, right? I'll read it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.31,0:08:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I see someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.99,0:08:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They ran off...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.78,0:09:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably because we're a big group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:01.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.04,0:09:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you sense the presence of an elfin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.08,0:09:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,How can there be spirits in a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.04,0:09:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw something about it on the elfin forum, so I wanted to check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.72,0:09:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the hottest topic on the forum right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.31,0:09:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a game... For elfin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.88,0:09:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's exactly the same as the real world!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.18,0:10:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This is fun even all by itself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.61,0:10:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's over ten million people online right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.51,0:10:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And the number is only growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,With that many players on the same server,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,and the fact we haven't seen anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.88,0:10:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,this world must be enourmous.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way this game could have a world chat,\Nthe chat box would explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.05,0:10:44.01,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,I can't summon Heixiu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though we can sense elfin and retain our abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.77,0:10:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,these bodies aren't our real bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.77,0:10:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,They're much weaker than in reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.44,0:10:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.11,0:10:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this considered a monster in the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.11,0:11:01.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What do we do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.35,0:11:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:20.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen, you're amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:21.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like I leveled up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,See, I'm level two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that your ability just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.10,0:11:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You can use it in the game then?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.39,0:11:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is connected to elfin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh? No wonder, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But what happens if Shanxin "dies"?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's log out first
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.03,0:11:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.36,0:11:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we log out?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.24,0:11:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, found it, it says logout here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.07,0:11:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.83,0:11:53.84,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an5}"Are you sure you want to log out?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.41,0:11:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It says you'll log back in at the same spot, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.13,0:11:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That was terrifying, getting stomped to death is terrifying...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you guys get killed by the monster too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.88,0:12:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Gen defeated it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.05,0:12:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's amazing! How did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That might be hard to explain...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret, can't say!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.68,0:12:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, a secret, never mind then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.77,0:12:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't saying it's a secret just makes it more intruging?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.73,0:12:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell secrets, but you can't lie about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shanxin really is Xiaobai's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.82,0:12:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe to fill her in on our secret, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.41,0:12:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Mhm! Of course
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits, elfins, a game for elfin... I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.55,0:12:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so cold to Huangshou from now on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.55,0:12:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are people these days really that accepting?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.01,0:12:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, Gen is still Gen!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.56,0:12:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei is still Xiaohei, nothing's changed
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,All this really means is...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,We're even stronger!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.62,0:13:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you only care about the game?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.28,0:13:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That said, the death penalty in this game is way too harsh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:08.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have to wait half an hour before I can get back in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.45,0:13:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, we can gather intel in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.71,0:13:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Mr. Fu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Playing the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Always thinking about fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.28,0:13:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Suits him well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.51,0:13:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's rare for us to have some peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.01,0:13:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.43,0:13:27.26,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ah!! You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:29.89,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I was having so much fun! Then I got ambushed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:32.04,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Now I have to wait half an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.06,0:13:34.18,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}When I get back in, I'm going to kick his ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems like Mr. Fu is really enjoying the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.31,0:13:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Elfin will have an advantage at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.48,0:13:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But after a while, he might not be so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.65,0:13:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this game made specifically for elfin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.00,0:13:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.98,0:13:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's only one of the reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What!?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.00,0:13:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All living creatures in this game are played by players.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.66,0:13:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,So all those animals we saw earlier were players as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.63,0:13:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.29,0:14:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder it's called All Living Beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.79,0:14:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so choosing a race is a feature of our limited edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,"Turned into a strange animal randomly"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.43,0:14:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"I am a pitcher plant"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.96,0:14:06.67,Default,,0,0,0,,As expected of a limited edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Some people are talking about factions and red names.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.85,0:14:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Characters start off belonging to the regional faction of their spawn point.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.81,0:14:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you kill someone in you faction, your name will turn red.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.82,0:14:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,However, other species aren't affected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,No ones sure what the red name does, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.44,0:14:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's not much information on gameplay yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.57,0:14:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Most people on the forums right now are dead players, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So there's limited info right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:34.50,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an5}"Can I earn real cash?\NThat's awesome"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.41,0:14:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The game has a way of earning real money?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.62,0:14:35.96,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an5}"First, I have to reincarnate as a human."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.16,0:14:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even notice. Let's check it out later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.30,0:14:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The rule about characters being deleted on death seems to have blown up online.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,There's already a protest thread. 
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.03,0:14:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah, that's a lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.01,0:14:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they'll end up changing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.84,0:14:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.89,0:14:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.12,0:14:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Gen have insider info?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The elfin forum is discussing it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.56,0:14:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The admin clearly responded that they won't change this rule.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I never noticed before, but the moderator is actually Kali.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.81,0:15:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.20,0:15:05.71,Default,,0,0,0,,A game for elfin...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.19,0:15:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would an elfin make a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,To make money
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.09,0:15:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,With such a punishing mechanic, won't it drive away players?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.16,0:15:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't put in for the purpose of making money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.29,0:15:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just to recreate the world's authenticity as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,However, with such advanced technology, it's impossible not to make money.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Since there's a player cap, I want the player quality to be higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who quit aren't the\Ntarget audience anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.81,0:15:33.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be good to filter them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.57,0:15:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The official response is out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:41.69,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an5}"The rules won't change.\N Limited to 50 million units."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.14,0:15:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.74,0:15:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So blunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.07,0:15:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Fifty million copies, is that a lot?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.75,0:15:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm..
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In terms of sales,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.47,0:15:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,it would rank in the top dozen or so in console history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.74,0:15:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one has ever limited console sales, let alone to 50 milllion.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.83,0:15:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised if there's even more backlash from players.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:16:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter, it's a seller's market.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.83,0:16:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,If rules get changed just because people oppose them...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.04,0:16:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where's the fun in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.38,0:16:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how high your level or how strong your abilities, one death resets everything to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.59,0:16:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The more I think about it, this enhances the realism.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.55,0:16:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen an MMO do this by default.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.35,0:16:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But that makes it even more interesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.60,0:16:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the players who embrace this rule can truly enjoy the game at it's full potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Games are only fun when they're challenging!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.69,0:16:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting fired up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.48,0:16:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you feel the adrenaline rush?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.90,0:16:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.61,0:16:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, time's up. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.08,0:16:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.16,0:16:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't a bird anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.01,0:16:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You can re-choose your race after death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.72,0:16:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get used to the game first.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, change your outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.39,0:16:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys look out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.63,0:17:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a ton of people over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.61,0:17:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like they're fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.53,0:17:10.67,Default,,0,0,0,,A boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.37,0:17:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This game has bosses too?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.70,0:17:17.66,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}No skills at all!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.78,0:17:18.83,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How are we supposed to fight this??
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.95,0:17:19.74,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}How should I know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.87,0:17:20.49,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Ahhhhhhhhhhh!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That hurts...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait wait wait!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.83,0:17:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's talk it out!!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a player too, right!?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.29,0:17:32.42,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?! How did you become a boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.55,0:17:35.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The game randomly asks players if they want to be a boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:39.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll assign a time and location, and gives extra abilities once there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You can move freely otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.06,0:17:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that cause issues?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.23,0:17:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.14,0:17:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But once everyone gradually understands what a boss is,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.90,0:17:50.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it'll be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Your boss role was assigned randomly, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.61,0:17:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's make a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.07,0:17:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you 2000¥ if you let me kill you. Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.12,0:18:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's so shameless!\NThis has to be an exploit!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's quiet today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.78,0:18:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I got an item!!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Every game has pay-to-win players.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They paid real money without even knowing what they'd get...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.25,0:18:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't we just rob this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.75,0:18:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.54,0:18:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. Items are usually bound or can have a low drop-rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:19:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,However, with the current death mechanic, all items should drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.09,0:19:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This would make players want to fight more.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.01,0:19:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't if I were you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.60,0:19:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,If you rob me, that'd just make you the next target.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.93,0:19:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, sure is realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.43,0:19:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we can choose races, can we choose to be a boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.40,0:19:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,We can try next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Somethings not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.36,0:19:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.78,0:19:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy getting robbed is getting stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.95,0:19:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.16,0:19:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Woah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.46,0:19:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm... Getting stronger...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.29,0:19:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's charging at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.17,0:19:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Gen, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.65,0:19:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was intense... It really felt like I was going to die...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:20:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What item did that guy get to be so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.44,0:20:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We all died this time, now we gotta wait another half hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.53,0:20:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This game is so hard, even Gen got taken out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy probably leveled up a lot while being ganged up on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.87,0:20:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's keep gathering intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.87,0:20:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei, choose human form this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,With how the game works, \Nit should be easier to use your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.13,0:20:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.80,0:20:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it got reported after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.88,0:20:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The game boss was bribed and dropped high-tier items.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.26,0:20:27.51,Default,,0,0,0,,The official response says this is part of the games experience and won't intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But the boss player has been noted as a disqualified,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And they won't get another chance to become a boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.23,0:20:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, the there's already someone who's already over level 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.98,0:20:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The game seems so unbalanced. How are they going to manage?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.49,0:20:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What level are we now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.70,0:20:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Level zero...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.62,0:20:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, this game is pretty fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.25,0:20:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.25,0:20:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's already compiled the experience values.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.67,0:21:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 1 requires 1 exp, Level 2 requires 2 exp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,And so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.90,0:21:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems simple enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.55,0:21:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But since all experience comes from PVP,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,gaining any becomes much harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.85,0:21:12.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The experience gained from killing a player isn't fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.48,0:21:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You get 30% of the target's total \Nexperience with a minimum gain of 1 exp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.77,0:21:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,At level 10 you unlock the ability "Level Eye" \Nwhich lets you see other players' levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.32,0:21:26.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only been two hours since launch, and there's already a 50-level gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.28,0:21:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on the experience accumulation logic,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.99,0:21:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,he's essentially killed over a thousand players.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.49,0:21:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That many!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.74,0:21:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, some of those taken down \Nhad to be high-level players.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.12,0:21:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So the actual kill count is at most a few hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.07,0:21:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,That's still a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.30,0:21:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How did they manage that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an extreme case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:45.68,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Sounds like they're talking about something impressive...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.13,0:21:46.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They probably obtained a large AOE attack skill or possibly a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.80,0:21:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Player levels are bound to be like a pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.01,0:21:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This game has no balance at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.19,0:21:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The main gameplay styles seem to be:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.87,0:22:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Faction warfare,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.47,0:22:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Faction warfare, city management,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.69,0:22:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Faction warfare, city management, exploration,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.91,0:22:04.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Faction warfare, city management, exploration, player hunters, and anti-hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.12,0:22:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How should we play then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.54,0:22:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's start with just surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:11.37,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Xiaohei, we'll be counting on you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:12.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Never thought a pro gamer like me would end up so behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.73,0:22:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright! Let's get into the game!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:14.63,Default - Italic,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.87,0:22:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a city this time? There's many people...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.97,0:22:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This city is way too generic. I was hoping for something original.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.47,0:22:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's not the time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.10,0:22:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna die!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.72,0:22:36.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How do we always end up running into this stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.73,0:22:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What level do you need to be to get that strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.85,0:22:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to see his level until we hit 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.31,0:22:43.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.90,0:22:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow! So fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.18,0:22:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,So strong!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.61,0:22:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.03,0:22:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did they level up?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.75,0:23:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably a skill that only high-level players have.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.39,0:23:22.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So intense...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.15,0:23:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all so strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.61,0:23:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is humilating! I've never been toyed like this in any game before.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.74,0:23:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Haha, but it's really fun though.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.28,0:23:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time we go in, we'll definitely have more experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.95,0:23:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I have to head back now, let's continue tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.08,0:23:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow won't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.37,0:23:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go do Xiaohei's mission early tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.50,0:23:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.36,0:24:17.74,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Stay with me - let's walk on, kicking pebbles as we go
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.74,0:24:22.48,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Our destination may be whimsical
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.48,0:24:27.18,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But with the scent of flowers in both hands
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.18,0:24:33.38,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,I’ll carry it to the you I’ve yet to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:39.53,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Wait for me — let’s talk, side by side
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.53,0:24:44.33,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Even if our first “hello” is a little awkward
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.33,0:24:49.01,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,When we open the boxes we’ve brought
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.01,0:24:55.53,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Let’s share the dreams we’ve packed inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.53,0:25:06.85,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,The days when we can casually say “See you tomorrow”
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.85,0:25:12.27,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Are so precious and so fleeting
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.27,0:25:17.31,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,Those feelings will never fade away
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.31,0:25:28.54,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,We can’t catch up to the clouds drifting across the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.54,0:25:34.09,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,But they’ll turn to rain, bloom into flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.09,0:25:40.93,Ending Song - English,,0,0,0,,And surely, they’re calling out to me
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.36,0:24:17.74,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Stay with me aruite yukou ishikoro wo kette
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.74,0:24:22.48,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Yukisaki wa kitto kimagure demo 
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.48,0:24:27.18,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hana no kaori wo ryoute ni
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.18,0:24:33.38,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,kore kara deau kimi e to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:39.53,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Wait for me hanashi wo shiyou kata wo narabete
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.53,0:24:44.33,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Hajimemashite wa gikochinaku temo
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.33,0:24:49.01,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mochiyotta hako aketara
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.01,0:24:55.53,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Tsumekon da yume wo wakeaou
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.53,0:25:06.85,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Mata ashita tte atarimae ni kawaseru hibi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.85,0:25:12.27,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Itoshikute hakanasugite
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.27,0:25:17.31,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Omoi wa kitto kienai
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.31,0:25:28.54,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Sora wo nagareru kumo ni wa oitsukenai kedo
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.54,0:25:34.09,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Ame ni natte hana wo tsukete kitto boku wo yonderu
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.09,0:25:40.93,Ending Song - Romaji,,0,0,0,,Kitto boku wo yonderu
